Omyvoid notices and provenance
==============================

This repository was initialized from a source snapshot of Omybuntu:

  Project: https://github.com/erickdevit/omybuntu
  Commit:  9e89dd355c48ef74eeead1ccf5a677d15293c826

The snapshot was imported as a new root commit without the upstream Git
history. Omybuntu itself is a port of Omarchy:

  Project: https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy

Omyvoid keeps attribution to those projects and their contributors. Files
derived from them remain subject to the license notices in their source.

Void Linux, XBPS, runit, Btrfs, dracut, Limine, Snapper, Hyprland and other
packaged components are independent projects and retain their respective
licenses and trademarks.

The Osaka Jade Limine wallpaper in default/limine/omyvoid-boot.png was derived
from the Omyvoid boot artwork approved for this project. It is a boot artifact
and is not offered as an additional desktop wallpaper.
